# Uldaros Theorix: "cast any number of spells with total mana value 6 or less". Bot1 (graveyard filled as in the neighbouring
# scenario: three Entombs take Tarfire, Mind Twist and The Theorist, Jace Beleren; Dark Ritual and the sacrificed Black Lotus
# are there too) exiles Lotus, Tarfire, Dark Ritual, Jace and Mind Twist. It casts Tarfire (1, a Kindred Instant - it
# is the kindred of the set, Dark Ritual the instant: a card is a target for one type, so Tarfire being both is no
# problem), Jace (4) and Mind Twist (1): 6 in all, the mana value of a copy cast for X of 0 being its printed one without
# the X. Mind Twist is cast for X = 0, so it discards nothing from Bot2's hand. Dark Ritual (1) is now over the six and
# is not offered; the Black Lotus (0) still is, and is cast. After that nothing is castable and no question is asked
# (the refusal) - the first question, with Dark Ritual in it, is the positive control.

